WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:09.581
A demo artifact can contain a chart or another image that is hard to read at its original size. Click the image to expand it across the screen and see the detail.

00:00:10.535 --> 00:00:18.093
The close button returns to the artifact where you left off. The Escape key works too, and images that already act as links keep their own action.
